        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Chili Con Carnage, Total Overdose\n- Companies: Deadline Games, Square Enix, Sci Entertainment, Eidos Interactive\n- Topics: action/adventure third-person shooter video games, open world video games\n\nFacts:\n- Chili Con Carnage is an action/adventure third-person shooter video game.\n- Total Overdose is also known as Total Overdose: A Gunslinger's Tale in Mexico and abbreviated as TOD.\n- Total Overdose is an open world action/adventure third-person shooter video game.\n- Deadline Games and Square Enix developed Total Overdose.\n- Sci Entertainment published Total Overdose in Europe.\n- Eidos Interactive published Total Overdose in North America.",
